(Is that tomorrow, Saturday morning 02:00, or Friday next week?
Always have to ask in case of non-standard time descriptions :-}
And mind the time zone, while we're at it. It's less ambiguous
and easier to answer if we knew how many hours you have left :-)

In a period of a week you can finish any game, but if you have
just less than half a day left it depends...

> I am a healer, fully decked out, [...]
> So, any chance at all?

Yes, if you already have the Bell and the Candelabrum and candles then
you just have to visit the Wizard to get the Book (maybe 10 minutes or
half an hour, depending on whether you use shortcuts or not). The same
amount for Moloch's Sanctum. The home-run through Gehennom depends on
how severe the force will throw you back, maybe 30 minutes. And doing
the Planes is a short session if you are prepared, maybe another half
an hour.

> For someone new to this part of the world, how
> much 'real-time' is left, before ascension?

Maybe two hours all in all. But don't take for granted that you
succeed; there are still some challenges, especially for the
unexperienced adventurer. Take care!

